{"id": 84, "name": "Ling", "splash": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_563f09baf8ad4675dace2f94af6436de.png", "cls": ["Assassin", ""], "specialty": ["Chase", "Burst"], "difficulty": "70", "stats": ["50", "60", "30", "70"], "lanes": ["Jungle", ""], "story": "A graceful, free-soaring Finch and the Oriental Fighter who inherited the Vermilion Bird's power.", "skills": [{"name": "Cloud Walker", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_c6e3165a768cb3fa557a83c287b9f459.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "Ling's superb Lightness Skill allows him to leap among walls. He gains 4 extra Lightness Points per second when he's on a wall and 5 extra Lightness Points each time he deals damage.\n\nLing gains 1.6 times Crit Chance from all sources but only has 140% Crit Damage."}, {"name": "Finch Poise", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_aacda39b0b019760c392c77045c7aa9a.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}, {"tagid": 62, "tagname": "Buff", "tagrgb": "79,156,184"}], "cdcost": "", "desc": "<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Passive</span>: Ling's Crit Chance is increased by 2.5%.\n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Active</span>: Ling leaps onto the designated wall and enters the <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Half-Stealth</span> state, restoring Lightness Points faster and gaining 30% Movement Speed. Taking damage causes him to leave <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Half-Stealth</span>. Being controlled makes him fall to the ground and slows him by 30% for 2s. When he uses this skill to jump from one wall to another, it does not trigger cooldown and refreshes <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Half-Stealth</span>."}, {"name": "Defiant Sword", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_c212eef502f9086513e0d8b5ad0ef8bb.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 33, "tagname": "Damage", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 81, "tagname": "Mobility", "tagrgb": "162,105,198"}], "cdcost": "CD: 2.5   Energy Cost: 35", "desc": "Ling charges in the target direction and stabs nearby enemies, dealing them 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span>.\nIf Ling casts this skill when he's on the wall (no energy cost), he'll dash to the target location on the ground, dealing 300<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+50% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the area and slowing them by 30% for 1.5s. \n<span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Defiant Sword</span> is regarded as Basic Attack."}, {"name": "Tempest of Blades", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage_92/100_f720a952a87a4873288aae54457aff7c.png", "tag": [{"tagid": 31, "tagname": "Burst", "tagrgb": "199,121,85"}, {"tagid": 21, "tagname": "CC", "tagrgb": "205,93,109"}], "cdcost": "CD: 52", "desc": "Ling leaps into the air, becoming invincible and gaining 10% extra Movement Speed for 1.5s. He ignores obstacles when in the air. He then lands on the ground, dealing 250<span style=\"color:#fba51f\"> (+100% Total Physical Attack)</span> <span style=\"color:#fb1f1f\">Physical Damage</span> to enemies in the area and slowing them by 40% for 1.5s, knocking those in the center airborne for 1s, and creating a Sword Field for 8s.\n\nFour <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Tempest of Blades</span> will also appear on the edge of the Sword Field. Ling can touch them to reduce the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Finch Poise</span> by 4s, reset the cooldown of <span style=\"color:#a6aafb\">Defiant Sword</span>, and gain 25 Lightness Points."}], "fullbuilds": [{"items": [{"name": "Berserker's Fury", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/mlbb/homepage/100_020f531307fa505083b791e6f3093eb4.png"}, {"name": "Haas' Claws", "icon": "https://akmweb.youngj